01:48.875 --> 01:49.875
Shimura!

01:50.791 --> 01:53.041
Tama na! Wag na 'ka mo siyang lumaban!

01:56.958 --> 01:58.666
Importante ba siya sa 'yo?

02:00.916 --> 02:02.291
Kung oo…

02:04.916 --> 02:06.625
dapat protektahan mo siya.

02:20.666 --> 02:22.500
Di na siya makakapag-calf kick.

02:28.625 --> 02:31.250
Shimura, tama na.

02:31.333 --> 02:33.666
Mamamatay ka pag tinuloy mo pa 'yan!

02:34.250 --> 02:35.500
Wag kang makialam.

02:37.791 --> 02:39.125
Shinjo…

02:40.125 --> 02:41.208
Masaya ka na ba?

02:42.625 --> 02:46.166
Pinakita mo sa kaibigan ko
na binubugbog mo 'ko.

02:49.250 --> 02:50.416
Hindi ka…

02:51.333 --> 02:53.500
psychopath.

02:55.833 --> 02:56.916
Ang totoo,

02:58.333 --> 03:02.291
naiinggit ka lang sa 'min.

03:03.125 --> 03:05.208
Ano'ng pinagsasasabi mo d'yan?

03:07.583 --> 03:09.000
Si Kanegon…

03:10.875 --> 03:13.208
'yong una kong best friend.

03:16.041 --> 03:19.000
Sinaktan mo 'yong kaibigan ko.

03:21.708 --> 03:24.416
Hinding-hindi kita mapapatawad.

03:28.416 --> 03:30.000
Tumahimik ka!

03:34.083 --> 03:35.458
Shimura!

03:36.250 --> 03:38.333
Ie-end ko na 'yong stream, Kanegon.

03:40.875 --> 03:42.291
Tapos na 'to.

03:44.291 --> 03:46.833
Akin na 'yong channel n'yo,
gaya ng usapan.

03:54.833 --> 03:56.125
Tama na.

03:56.208 --> 03:57.375
Ano?

03:57.458 --> 03:58.625
Tumigil na 'ko.

03:59.375 --> 04:01.375
Tama na, please.

04:02.041 --> 04:02.875
Tapos na nga.

04:02.958 --> 04:05.000
Lintik! Sabi nang tama na, e!

04:05.083 --> 04:06.666
Shimura!

04:15.541 --> 04:16.375
BUMANGON SIYA!

04:16.458 --> 04:17.666
LABAN, SHIMURA!

04:19.875 --> 04:21.708
Paano tatalunin ng baguhan…

04:24.041 --> 04:25.750
ang isang taekwondo…

04:26.333 --> 04:29.458
Nababaliw ka na ba?

04:31.291 --> 04:32.458
…fighter.

04:34.208 --> 04:38.125
Pag sinipa kita d'yan,
mamamatay ka talaga.

04:39.291 --> 04:40.875
Rule one.

04:43.791 --> 04:44.791
Sige.

04:48.166 --> 04:49.583
Tatapusin kita.

04:55.416 --> 04:56.708
Mamatay ka na!

05:00.333 --> 05:05.833
Paano tatalunin ng baguhan
ang isang taekwondo fighter, rule one.

05:08.333 --> 05:12.708
Kontrolin mo ang paligid
para mapigilan 'yong mga sipa niya!

05:12.791 --> 05:15.208
Para sa technique na 'to ang lahat.

05:18.708 --> 05:22.375
Hawakan mo 'yong likod ng kuwelyo niya
na parang may hawak kang baseball bat,

05:22.458 --> 05:25.000
tapos buhatin mo siya sa balikat mo!

05:28.291 --> 05:30.500
Wow, baseball choke!

05:48.083 --> 05:48.916
Kaya mo 'yan.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.583
GRABE!

05:52.666 --> 05:54.041
WAG KANG BIBITAW!

05:54.625 --> 05:55.625
Kaya mo 'yan, Shimura.

06:30.875 --> 06:32.875
Knock out! Panalo si Shimura.

06:35.958 --> 06:37.083
Nanalo ka!

06:37.166 --> 06:38.708
Shimura, nanalo ka!

06:46.500 --> 06:48.291
Knock out na! Patigilin mo na siya!

06:53.166 --> 06:54.041
Tapos na!

06:54.125 --> 06:55.958
-Bumitaw ka na!
-Shimura!

06:56.541 --> 06:59.625
Shimura, mamamatay siya pag di ka bumitaw!

06:59.708 --> 07:00.875
Shimura!

07:03.458 --> 07:04.291
