08:01.416 --> 08:02.250
Ha?

08:03.541 --> 08:04.833
Sa 'yo na 'to.

08:04.916 --> 08:06.791
Pero, Shinjo, 'yan 'yong…

08:06.875 --> 08:07.750
Sige na.

08:08.250 --> 08:10.416
Isuot mo 'yan, tapos magpalakas ka.

08:11.375 --> 08:12.208
Sure ka?

08:13.875 --> 08:14.916
Thank you.

08:16.541 --> 08:19.125
Iingatan ko 'to habambuhay.

08:25.041 --> 08:27.166
Nasa lumang Ikebe factory site si Takuma.

08:43.333 --> 08:44.208
Takuma!

08:45.791 --> 08:46.625
Hoy!

08:47.333 --> 08:48.208
Wag kang mamamatay!

08:53.500 --> 08:54.333
Sorry.

08:55.833 --> 08:57.125
Hindi ko kinayang…

08:57.833 --> 08:59.583
maging malakas…

09:06.208 --> 09:07.041
Hoy.

09:08.750 --> 09:09.583
Gumising ka.

09:12.625 --> 09:14.333
Sabi nang gumising ka, e!

09:14.416 --> 09:15.333
Takuma!

09:49.916 --> 09:52.333
Tara na, bubugbugin pa tayo nito
pag nagising siya.

09:52.416 --> 09:54.208
Di natin siya pwedeng iwan nang ganito.

10:04.375 --> 10:05.625
Ano'ng ginagawa n'yo?

10:05.708 --> 10:07.333
Mali 'yong iniisip mo.

10:07.416 --> 10:09.125
Medyo sumobra kasi 'to, e.

10:09.708 --> 10:12.000
