10:38.333 --> 10:40.833
Ano'ng sinasabi mo d'yan? Hindi siguro.

10:42.041 --> 10:43.875
Okay lang ba 'yong paa mo?

10:43.958 --> 10:45.708
A, e, siguro.

10:45.791 --> 10:46.750
Talaga?

11:00.291 --> 11:03.500
MAS INTENSE PA KESA SA BAD FELLOWS!

11:03.583 --> 11:06.250
