15:28.583 --> 15:31.958
Saka deserve mo ring
i-treat 'yong sarili mo. Di ba, Aki?

15:32.458 --> 15:34.750
Nasa kanya na 'yon.

15:34.833 --> 15:36.583
Oo nga, pero…

15:37.916 --> 15:40.208
Aamin ka kay Asamiya, di ba?

15:43.250 --> 15:44.083
Oo.

15:44.166 --> 15:48.083
Di maganda kung aamin ka
tapos ganyan 'yong sapatos mo.

15:48.166 --> 15:49.000
Okay?

16:06.000 --> 16:07.583
