17:22.041 --> 17:27.416
Papasok na ulit ako sa trabaho bukas.

17:28.166 --> 17:33.500
Pwede bang sabay tayong umuwi?

18:01.541 --> 18:03.291
Anong simpleng trabaho?

18:07.875 --> 18:09.041
Okay…

18:10.083 --> 18:10.916
Eto.

18:11.916 --> 18:13.125
Pumili ka dito.

18:13.208 --> 18:14.791
CLIENT LIST

18:15.291 --> 18:16.500
BUSINESS OWNER

18:16.583 --> 18:17.708
CHIEF DIRECTOR

18:21.000 --> 18:22.708
Ano 'to?

18:25.791 --> 18:26.958
Sila 'yong…

18:27.041 --> 18:28.458
