21:13.125 --> 21:16.250
Wag n'yo na pong singilin ng medical fees
'yong mama ni Shimura.

21:19.041 --> 21:20.041
Please po.

21:38.083 --> 21:39.041
Shimura?

22:38.166 --> 22:39.958
-Yes!
-Tama na!

22:41.666 --> 22:44.208
Tama na! Ibalik n'yo sa 'kin 'yan!

22:48.833 --> 22:49.666
Tara na!

22:49.750 --> 22:51.000
-Ang saya no'n!
-Oo nga.

23:00.416 --> 23:01.250
Okay ka lang?

23:05.083 --> 23:08.541
Hinahanap ko 'yong chick keychain ko.

23:10.125 --> 23:12.041
Shimura, ano'ng ginagawa mo?

23:12.625 --> 23:13.666
