24:08.375 --> 24:09.333
Excuse me.

24:10.500 --> 24:12.083
Kasama n'yo ba si Shimura?

24:12.583 --> 24:13.458
Di siya pupunta.

24:14.458 --> 24:16.791
Naospital 'yong mama niya.

24:17.541 --> 24:18.375
Eto, o.

24:18.958 --> 24:21.083
Pinapabigay sa 'yo ni Shimura.

24:25.208 --> 24:27.250
May cabbage butterfly, o.

24:27.333 --> 24:28.333
Tara!

24:39.083 --> 24:41.416
MAGPALAKAS KA PA!
NEWTUBE @VIRAL_HIT

24:47.875 --> 24:49.833
In-offer-an tayo ng BAD FELLOWS?

24:49.916 --> 24:51.416
Oo! Ang galing, di ba?

24:51.500 --> 24:53.416
